          "V"
        ],
        "schema_changes": [],
        "innovation_reason": "Formalizes atomic actions on items, turning an open‑ended construction into an enumerable optimization over editing sequences.",
        "difficulty_reason": "The trade‑off between operation cost and target payment creates a multi‑objective optimization that must be proven correct with respect to the original coverage rule."
      },
